    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1018">

                <pb facs="0977" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg719"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.731/628</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)
                        <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-17T17:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 17, 1915, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2310. Your 1715, June 15, 9 p. m. Am informed at Foreign Office that British
                    Government has refused definitely to give consent to Netherlands Oversea Trust
                    plan for transmission of cables.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Ambassador</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
